  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "const = (((\\[Gamma] + 1)/(\\[Gamma] - 1)) ^ (\\[Gamma] + 1))/(2  \\[Gamma]  (\\[Gamma] - 1));\n\n\\[Lambda] = (2 * \\[Delta] + \\[Omega] * (\\[Gamma] - 1)) / (3 - \\[Omega]);\n\nG = (const (C ^ 2) (\\[Xi] ^ (2 - 3 \\[Lambda])) ((1 - U) ^ (-\\[Lambda]))) ^ (1/(\\[Gamma] - 1 + \\[Lambda]));\n\nG = Simplify[G];\n\nP = \\[Xi]^2 G C^2 / \\[Gamma];\nP = Simplify[P];\n\n\ndelta0 = C^2 - (1 - U)^2;\ndelta1 = U (1 - U) (1 - U - \\[Delta]) - C^2 (3 U + (- \\[Omega] + 2 \\[Delta]) / \\[Gamma]);\ndelta2 = C (1 - U) (1 - U - \\[Delta]) - (\\[Gamma] - 1) C U (2 - 2 U + \\[Delta]) / 2 - (C^3) + (2 \\[Delta] + (\\[Gamma] - 1) \\[Omega]) (C^3)/(2 \\[Gamma] (1 - U));\n\ndUdx = delta1 / (delta0 \\[Xi]);\ndCdx = delta2 / (delta0 \\[Xi]);\n\n\ndGdx = (2 dCdx/C + \\[Lambda] dUdx/(1 - U) + (2 - 3 \\[Lambda])/\\[Xi]) G / (\\[Gamma] - 1 + \\[Lambda]);\n\ndPdx = (2 dCdx/C + dGdx/G + 2/\\[Xi]) P;\n\n\n\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
